		[ 'Mesh', Mesh ],
		[ 'Line', Line ],
		[ 'LineLoop', LineLoop ],
		[ 'LineSegments', LineSegments ],
		[ 'Points', Points ],
		[ 'Sprite', Sprite ],
		[ 'Group', Group ],
		[ 'Bone', Bone ]
	];

	it.each( simpleTypes )( 'creates a %s for type "%s"', ( type, Expected ) => {

		const object = parse( { type, uuid: 'uuid-' + type } );

		expect( object ).toBeInstanceOf( Expected );
		expect( object.uuid ).toBe( 'uuid-' + type );

	} );

	it( 'maps the legacy type "PointCloud" to Points', () => {

		const object = parse( { type: 'PointCloud', uuid: 'pc' } );

		expect( object ).toBeInstanceOf( Points );
		expect( object.isPoints ).toBe( true );

	} );

	it( 'falls back to Object3D for an unknown type', () => {

		const object = parse( { type: 'SomeUndefinedType', uuid: 'unknown' } );

		expect( object ).toBeInstanceOf( Object3D );
		expect( object.type ).toBe( 'Object3D' );
		expect( object.uuid ).toBe( 'unknown' );

	} );

	it( 'uses Object3D when no type is provided', () => {

		const object = parse( { uuid: 'no-type' } );

		expect( object ).toBeInstanceOf( Object3D );

	} );

} );

describe( 'ObjectLoader.parseObject() - common properties', () => {

	it( 'always assigns the serialized uuid', () => {

		expect( parse( { type: 'Group', uuid: 'abc-123' } ).uuid ).toBe( 'abc-123' );

	} );

	it( 'copies name, visibility and rendering flags', () => {

